{
  "schema": "starci/project-ext@1",
  "api": 1,
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "NIVO-NAMES-1",
      "code": "NIVO_TOOL_ID_TYPED",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-NAMES-1.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "packages/blocks-core/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/blocks-core/src/**/*.tsx",
        "packages/nivo-web-core/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/nivo-web-core/src/**/*.tsx"
      ],
      "lint": {
        "tool": "eslint",
        "file": "tool-ids-from-names.mjs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "NIVO-NAMES-2",
      "code": "NIVO_NAME_LEVEL_CROSSED",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-NAMES-2.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "packages/*/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/*/src/**/*.tsx",
        "fe/**/*.ts",
        "fe/**/*.tsx"
      ],
      "lint": {
        "tool": "eslint",
        "file": "node-level-names.mjs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "NIVO-NODES-1",
      "code": "NIVO_NODE_PROVIDER_LOGIC",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-NODES-1.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "packages/*/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/*/src/**/*.tsx"
      ],
      "lint": {
        "tool": "eslint",
        "file": "no-provider-logic-in-nodes.mjs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "NIVO-TIERS-1",
      "code": "NIVO_TEMPLATE_TIER_HOME",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-TIERS-1.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "packages/*/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/*/src/**/*.tsx",
        "be/src/**/*.ts"
      ],
      "lint": {
        "tool": "eslint",
        "file": "template-tier-homes.mjs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "NIVO-GRAPHS-1",
      "code": "NIVO_GRAPH_NOT_DATA",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-GRAPHS-1.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "packages/*/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/*/src/**/*.tsx"
      ],
      "lint": {
        "tool": "eslint",
        "file": "graphs-are-data.mjs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "NIVO-TOOLS-1",
      "code": "NIVO_TOOL_DEFINED_OUTSIDE_ENGINE",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-TOOLS-1.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "be/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/*/src/**/*.ts",
        "packages/*/src/**/*.tsx",
        "fe/**/*.ts",
        "fe/**/*.tsx"
      ],
      "lint": {
        "tool": "eslint",
        "file": "tools-defined-in-engine.mjs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "NIVO-EXT-1",
      "code": "NIVO_EXT_CONCEPT_UNKNOWN",
      "severity": "error",
      "doc": "ext/docs/NIVO-EXT-1.md",
      "appliesTo": [
        "ext/manifest.json",
        "ext/docs/**/*.md",
        "ext/lint/*.mjs",
        ".starciwork/concepts/*.md"
      ],
      "hfs": "concept-keys.mjs"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "registry",
      "run": "ext/checks/registry.mjs",
      "why": "The generated plugin registry equals what the installed plugins declare (.starciwork/concepts/templates.md: packages describe templates, one generated registry installs them)."
    },
    {
      "id": "seed-graphs",
      "run": "ext/checks/seed-graphs.mjs",
      "why": "Each dev seed graph equals the installed primary graph of its template agent (.starciwork/concepts/seeds-and-data.md: the running tier is the installed template, never a hand-edited copy)."
    },
    {
      "id": "tool-names",
      "run": "ext/checks/tool-names.mjs",
      "why": "No retired tool id and no id outside the three-level name law is written anywhere in the repository (.starciwork/concepts/tools.md: nivo.api, nivo.tool, nivo.trigger)."
    },
    {
      "id": "account-data",
      "run": "ext/checks/account-data.mjs",
      "why": "The committed DDL of every declared account data type equals what the generator renders (.starciwork/concepts/account-data.md: one partition per declared type, its checks and indexes generated)."
    },
    {
      "id": "crm-names",
      "run": "ext/checks/crm-names.mjs",
      "why": "A CRM provider via OpenAPI: every package's api.generated.ts equals what its pinned src/crm/<id>/openapi.json gives, every nivo.api.crm.<id>.* it names is an operation of its own pin, declared sources have their document, CRM ids are unique across packages, and no nivo.tool.crm.* is hand-named (.starciwork/concepts/tools.md, providers.md)."
    },
    {
      "id": "record-names",
      "run": "ext/checks/record-names.mjs",
      "why": "Every installed record type is <package>.<agent>.<domain> and every record read <package>.<agent>.api.<domain>.<query> of its own plugin's package and agents, and refs and reads reach only their own agent's types (.starciwork/concepts/records.md: records are the mini-database of agents)."
    },
    {
      "id": "record-ddl",
      "run": "ext/checks/record-ddl.mjs",
      "why": "The committed entities manifest and fresh-database DDL equal what the record type declarations render, keys unique per workspace and agent (.starciwork/concepts/records.md: DDL generated from the declarations, checked)."
    },
    {
      "id": "nivo-api-graphql",
      "run": "ext/checks/nivo-api-graphql.mjs",
      "why": "Every NIVO-owned API name maps 1:1 to one GraphQL operation of the contract through the declared table, and the two agree (.starciwork/concepts/tools.md: nivo.api.nivo.* and GraphQL, one declaration, no drift)."
    },
    {
      "id": "mcp-tools",
      "run": "ext/checks/mcp-tools.mjs",
      "why": "The outbound MCP surface's tool list is generated from the NIVO data op declarations and equals its committed contract snapshot, with few client-safe, fully annotated tools (.starciwork/concepts/mcp.md: generated exposure, few tools, annotations)."
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-imports",
      "run": "ext/checks/engine-imports.mjs",
      "why": "The engine (be/**) and the front end (fe/apps/*/src, fe/packages/*/src) import neither blocks-core nor nivo-web-core, and the plugin registry only at the composition roots listed in COMPOSITION_ROOTS; agent-sdk imports none of the three (.starciwork/concepts/layers.md: the engine holds no business)."
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-business-contracts",
      "run": "ext/checks/engine-business-contracts.mjs",
      "why": "The engine and agent-sdk name only the service contracts listed as generic in layers.md (no contract of one module's business, no domain module wrapping one), and a provider module (one that registers itself in a provider registry at boot) imports among the domain pieces only the table of providers.md (.starciwork/concepts/layers.md rule 14, providers.md rule 13)."
    },
    {
      "id": "template-tools",
      "run": "ext/checks/template-tools.mjs",
      "why": "A template lists only tools that act outside or on other people: the default record, file, timer and read-context tools are never listed, except an AI read a node's own code calls or requires (.starciwork/concepts/nivo-toolset.md: two default sets, one declaration each)."
    }
  ],
  "packages": {
    "packages/agent-sdk": {
      "closed": true,
